<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>高频考点汇总</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js">
</script>
<style>
  body {
    background-color: #dfe3d5;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px 0;
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
  }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    width: 540px;
    min-height: 700px;
    background-color: #f4f1e6;
    border: 2px solid #333;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    padding: 20px 25px 40px 25px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .title-wrap {
    position: relative;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .title-bar {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #a8b98c;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 8px 30px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .mascot-top {
    position: absolute;
    top: -55px;
    right: 20px;
    width: 70px;
    height: 70px;
  }

  .section-header {
    background-color: #a8b98c;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: bold;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: 14px 0 8px 0;
  }

  p.line {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    color: #333;
    margin: 6px 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .stars {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 10px;
    color: #f5a623;
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 11px;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
  }

  .mascot-mid {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    right: 15px;
    top: 195px;
  }

  .mascot-bottom {
    width: 90px;
    height: 90px;
    right: 25px;
    top: 590px;
  }

  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 10px;
    right: 20px;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #999;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .footer .handle {
    color: #666;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">

  <div class="title-wrap">
    <span class="title-bar">高频考点汇总</span>
    <div class="placeholder mascot-top" style="top:-55px; right:20px; width:70px; height:70px;">
      [Illustration: cartoon bear mascot holding pencil]
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <span class="section-header">(五)设计选项卡考点</span>
    <p class="line">1.设计一设置背景格式</p>
    <p class="line">2.设计幻灯片主题，调整主题字体</p>
    <p class="line">和主题颜色</p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <span class="section-header">(六)切换考点</span>
    <p class="line">1.基础考点</p>
    <p class="line">2.设置幻灯片自动放映：切换一</p>
    <p class="line">勾选【设置自动换片时间】</p>
    <p class="line">一设置时间一点击应用到全部</p>
  </div>

  <div class="placeholder mascot-mid" style="position:absolute; width:100px; height:100px; right:15px; top:195px;">
    [Illustration: cartoon sheep with flower]
  </div>

  <div>
    <span class="section-header">(七)动画考点</span>
    <span class="stars">★★★★★</span>
    <p class="line">1.常规考点，动画效果，设置多个动画，</p>
    <p class="line">利用【动画窗格】选择调整动画顺序</p>
    <p class="line">2.设置动画计时</p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <span class="section-header">(八)视图选项卡考点</span>
    <p class="line">1.颜色，灰度，黑白模式的调整</p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <span class="section-header">(九)幻灯片放映</span>
    <p class="line">设置幻灯片放映等</p>
  </div>

  <div class="placeholder mascot-bottom" style="position:absolute; width:90px; height:90px; right:25px; top:590px;">
    [Illustration: cartoon sheep, sad expression]
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <span class="handle">☆多喏喏小姐</span><br>
    From 小红书
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
